<title>USA: TABLE - REALCO INC Q3 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - REALCO INC Q3 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended June 30,</p>
<p>						1997 (a)		1996</p>
<p> Revenues				  $8,815,597	$6,121,263</p>
<p> Cost and Expenses			8,323,125	 5,983,438</p>
<p> Pre Tax Income			     492,472	   137,825</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense			 191,500	    50,620</p>
<p>Net earnings Available for</p>
<p>   Common Shares			    270,425	    58,480</p>
<p> Net Earnings Per Common Share (a)	  .10		 .03</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common</p>
<p>   Shares Outstanding		   2,820,489	 2,845,000</p>
<p>				   For the nine months ended June 30,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenues				 $25,378,680     $16,413,878</p>
<p> Cost and Expenses		     24,765,929	16,177,214</p>
<p> Pre Tax Income			     612,751	   236,664</p>
<p> Income Tax Expense			 244,000	    80,500</p>
<p>Net earnings Available For</p>
<p>   Common Shares			    277,110	    69,989</p>
<p> Net Earnings Per Common Share (a)	  .13		 .07</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common</p>
<p>   Shares Outstanding		   2,835,130	 2,381,496</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Results for Q3 1997 includes full results from a New Mexico-based brokerage company acquired in May 1997.</p>
<p>Results for the current nine-month period include an Arizona-based brokerage company acquired in January 1997.</p>
<p>The company said current results reflect strong earnings from its financial services group and contributions from acquisitions.</p>
<p>Realco Inc completed its initial public offering in Feb 1996.</p>
